{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw Sword is a highly creative Vampire Survivors-like action roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control an adorable little bean, drawing its movement paths by hand to determine how it moves and attacks, carving out a slim chance of survival amid swarming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stroke becomes a real movement trajectory and attack path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your direction in advance, weave through enemy formations, or precisely eliminate high-threat targets \u2014 every decision is yours to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trajectory as Blade \u2014 Draw Your Path of Attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.poster.avif?t=1772162626\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.webm?t=1772162626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.mp4?t=1772162626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-draw your route; the bean moves along it and attacks automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each designed path is a tactical choice between offense and retreat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics collisions and momentum to create combos and fluid movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One stroke can decide life or death \u2014 precision determines the battlefield</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Items \u2014 Build Diverse Combat Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/798d316d40d62b40538e204e9dc3145d.poster.avif?t=1772162626\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/798d316d40d62b40538e204e9dc3145d.webm?t=1772162626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons and items to freely combine into unique builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various monsters and increasingly intense waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and enhance abilities to shape your own growth path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold and purchase equipment to construct your personal combat style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wave Survival \u2014 Precision Decisions Within Limited Actions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.poster.avif?t=1772162626\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.webm?t=1772162626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.mp4?t=1772162626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy waves continue until your action count runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate as many enemies as possible within limited turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and strengthen attributes to increase combat power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek the optimal solution under pressure and survive to the very end</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pass Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/3ced540b4979a2f60905db826c572b6f808b02f4.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/fcf6f5cc7c65777934836c27a208d294b9c5cf95.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/4ed5f46f126dc1f8afced0579624572b8850987f.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/445e34fb19c34b0b699e7672450fcb992535f9be.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/dc8847678e76579f94bfdd3a59ba90e1789b1fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 100 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/c6416e1a81e4ca968a313589e4149071fd7eae97.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 300 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/ca5354f82ea633eced34a3dcac706ebd32628542.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 500 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/71039d906a603e331710ad6d1afe56995e73f431.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 1000 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/0316edc6653cac85c08473cabdde8000dee252cc.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 3000 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/5ab6a93a5f4b73e1ff2554f286b5d7e9f5ec5089.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886770?t=1772162626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/f18b66c9c9dff1267cfa681f5